sequenceDiagram
    participant LI as Line Items
    participant RA as Ratio Engine
    participant BM as Benchmark Engine
    participant TR as Trend Engine
    participant SC as Scorecard Engine
    participant OUT as Assessment Output

    LI->>RA: Normalized financial values
    RA-->>BM: Latest ratios
